**Invalid Outputs** (DO NOT DO THIS):

❌ Markdown code blocks:
```json
[...]
```

❌ Only 1 subtask:
[
  {"description": "...", "config": {...}}
]

❌ Too many subtasks (4+):
[
  {...}, {...}, {...}, {...}
]

❌ Missing required fields:
